{
  "_note": "The intent classes each domain's agent is configured for. Charter 3.9.4 keeps out-of-scope contacts in the containment denominator and reports the in-scope-only figure in its own column. This file is what defines in scope, and it is published so that the two columns can be checked against each other.",
